    "detail": "The 39 opinion texts ship in sources/ (headed and unheaded), pinned by sha256 in items/MANIFEST.json. From the repository root, after npm install && npm run build, node packages/verify/docs/bench/legal-blind-2/rerun.mjs reruns half A, the tuning search, half B and the unheaded step with the package's engine and compares every case with results/; on 2026-10-06 every outcome the table counts was identical (160 of 160, and the tuning search's values and chosen limits). Two things differ and the script says so: the verdict ids and some explanation wording, because today's engine is not the build the run used (its sources are hashed below), and rerun.mjs was written after the run in place of harness/run.ts, which imports the authors' working tree. The script that built the texts from the raw Caselaw Access Project files does not ship (it names the authors' folders); the raw files are pinned by URL, time and sha256 in sources/fetch-log.jsonl.",
